title: "Stateline: form fields whose border is their state"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jacques
    family-names: Ramphal
    website: "https://ramphal.design"
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-11-19
license: MIT
url: "https://ramphal.design/doc/make-it-pop"
repository-artifact: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/@jacquesramphal/stateline"
abstract: >-
  Form fields whose border is their state. The outline follows the caret,
  goes jagged when the input is wrong, circles while it sends and flies
  apart when it is sent, and every element enhances a real one. From the
  essay Make it pop.
keywords:
  - forms
  - input
  - animation
  - accessibility
